TLE: "Form fields must not have more than one label.", ACCESSIBILITY_FORM_FIELD_MULTIPLE_LABELS_FIX: "\u201CForm element has more than one associated <label>.\u201D", ACCESSIBILITY_INPUT_BUTTON_NAME_TITLE: "Inputs and selects must have accessible labels. (AMP Form)", ACCESSIBILITY_INPUT_BUTTON_NAME_FIX: "\u201CFix any of the following: Input of type=button/submit/image has no value or aria-label. / Add a <label> element, aria-label, or aria-labelledby for this input.\u201D", ACCESSIBILITY_LIST_ITEM_TITLE: "Lists must have proper list and list item structure.", ACCESSIBILITY_LIST_ITEM_FIX: "\u201CFix any of the following: Element is not contained within a valid list element (ul, ol). / Wrap list items inside <ul> or <ol> elements.\u201D", ACCESSIBILITY_SCROLLABLE_REGION_FOCUSABLE_TITLE: "Scrollable regions must be focusable for keyboard users.", ACCESSIBILITY_SCROLLABLE_REGION_FOCUSABLE_FIX: "\u201CAdd tabindex=0 to scrollable regions to allow keyboard access.\u201D", ACCESSIBILITY_TD_HEADERS_ATTR_TITLE: "Table headers and cells must be properly associated.", ACCESSIBILITY_TD_HEADERS_ATTR_FIX: "\u201CThe headers attribute references non-existent <th> elements.\u201D", ACCESSIBILITY_TH_HAS_DATA_CELLS_TITLE: "Table headers and cells must be properly associated.", ACCESSIBILITY_TH_HAS_DATA_CELLS_FIX: "\u201CTable header is not associated with any data cells.\u201D", ACCESSIBILITY_VALID_LANG_TITLE: "Language codes must be valid.", ACCESSIBILITY_VALID_LANG_FIX: "\u201CUse a valid BCP 47 language tag.\u201D", ACCESSIBILITY_VIDEO_CAPTION_TITLE: "Video elements must include captions.", ACCESSIBILITY_VIDEO_CAPTION_FIX: "Stripo video blocks are rendered as linked images, not <video> elements, so this rule does not apply.", ACCESSIBILITY_AUTOCOMPLETE_VALID_TITLE: "Autocomplete attribute has valid value", ACCESSIBILITY_AUTOCOMPLETE_VALID_FIX: "Ensure the autocomplete attribute is correct and suitable for the form field", ACCESSIBILITY_AVOID_INLINE_SPACINGS_TITLE: "Line height, Word/ Letter spacing in style attributes is not !important", ACCESSIBILITY_AVOID_INLINE_SPACINGS_FIX: "Ensure that text spacing set through style attributes can be adjusted with custom stylesheets", ACCESSIBILITY_TARGET_SIZE_TITLE: "All touch targets must be 24px large, or leave sufficient space", ACCESSIBILITY_TARGET_SIZE_FIX: "Ensure touch targets have sufficient size and space", ACCESSIBILITY_DUPLICATE_ID_ARIA_TITLE: "Elements with ARIA IDs must be unique.", ACCESSIBILITY_DUPLICATE_ID_ARIA_FIX: "\u201CThe id referenced by aria-labelledby or aria-describedby is not unique.\u201D", ACCESSIBILITY_AREA_ALT_TITLE: "<area> elements in image maps must have alt text.", ACCESSIBILITY_AREA_ALT_FIX: "\u201CFix any of the following: Element does not have an alt attribute; aria-label attribute does not exist or is empty; aria-labelledby attribute does not reference an element\u201D", ACCESSIBILITY_ARIA_ALLOWED_ALT_TITLE: "ARIA attributes must be valid for the element\u2019s role.", ACCESSIBILITY_ARIA_ALLOWED_ALT_FIX: "\u201CRemove invalid ARIA attributes. The attribute \u2018aria-[name]\u2019 is not allowed on this element.\u201D", ACCESSIBILITY_ARIA_COMMAND_NAME_TITLE: "ARIA buttons/links/menuitems need an accessible name.", ACCESSIBILITY_ARIA_COMMAND_NAME_FIX: "\u201CRemove invalid ARIA attributes. The attribute \u2018aria-[name]\u2019 is not allowed on this element.\u201D", ACCESSIBILITY_ARIA_CONDITIONAL_ATTR_TITLE: "ARIA attributes must follow role-specific requirements.", ACCESSIBILITY_ARIA_CONDITIONAL_ATTR_FIX: "\u201CEnsure attribute is used only when the required role or state is present.\u201D", ACCESSIBILITY_ARIA_DEPRECATED_ROLE_TITLE: "Avoid deprecated ARIA roles.", ACCESSIBILITY_ARIA_DEPRECATED_ROLE_FIX: "\u201CReplace deprecated role with a supported ARIA role.\u201D", ACCESSIBILITY_ARIA_HIDDEN_BODY_TITLE: 'The <body> element cannot have aria-hidden="true".', ACCESSIBILITY_ARIA_HIDDEN_BODY_FIX: '\u201CRemove aria-hidden="true" from the <body> element.\u201D', ACCE